WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.346
Chuck: It's coming right for us!

2
00:00:16.347 --> 00:00:20.828
Dave: I've . . . I've never been so scared in my life.

3
00:00:20.829 --> 00:00:24.145
Chuck: I'm too scared to move!

4
00:00:24.146 --> 00:00:33.325
Dave: Me too. It's like my feet are stuck to the ground.

5
00:00:33.326 --> 00:00:35.539
Chuck: I don't know what to do!

6
00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.244
Dave: Hold me!

7
00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:39.653
Chuck: Okay.

8
00:00:39.654 --> 00:00:42.807
Dave: I'm going to miss you, Chuck!

9
00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:45.200
Chuck: I'm going to miss you, Dave!

10
00:00:45.201 --> 00:00:49.251
Chuck & Dave: You're my best friend in the world!

11
00:00:49.252 --> 00:00:55.913
Chuck & Dave: Aaah!

12
00:00:55.914 --> 00:00:59.187
Chuck: It . . . it went down a hole!

13
00:00:59.188 --> 00:01:01.167
Dave: We're okay!

14
00:01:01.168 --> 00:01:03.853
Chuck: It's not going to hurt us!

15
00:01:03.854 --> 00:01:11.149
Chuck & Dave: Yaaay!

16
00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:13.042
Chuck: Did you just hug me?

17
00:01:13.043 --> 00:01:15.305
Dave: No way!

18
00:01:15.306 --> 00:01:18.128
Chuck: You were crying like a baby!

19
00:01:18.129 --> 00:01:19.727
Dave: I was not!

20
00:01:19.728 --> 00:01:28.021
You were the baby!

21
00:01:28.022 --> 00:01:30.980
Chuck: You were scared like a little girl!

22
00:01:30.981 --> 00:01:35.266
Dave: You were too scared to move!

23
00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:38.531
Chuck: Wait a minute. Stop.

24
00:01:38.532 --> 00:01:42.726
Let's calm down.

25
00:01:42.727 --> 00:01:46.732
Dave: I'm calm. And I'm not scared.

26
00:01:46.733 --> 00:01:50.349
Chuck: Good. Now, let's make a promise.

27
00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:51.774
Dave: What?

28
00:01:51.775 --> 00:01:56.548
Chuck: Promise that we will never, ever mention what just happened.

29
00:01:56.549 --> 00:02:01.303
Dave: I agree. No one must know how scared we were.

30
00:02:01.304 --> 00:02:04.271
Chuck: We'll pretend that it never happened.

31
00:02:04.272 --> 00:02:06.114
Dave: What never happened?

32
00:02:06.115 --> 00:02:10.430
Chuck: Exactly. It's forgotten already.

33
00:02:10.431 --> 00:02:14.126
Dave: I wonder what kind of monster that was.

34
00:02:14.127 --> 00:02:16.843
Chuck: It looked like a regular worm.

35
00:02:16.844 --> 00:02:18.645
Dave: You're right.

36
00:02:18.646 --> 00:02:23.575
Chuck: But that worm was big enough to squash us!

37
00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:26.472
Dave: This sure is a strange land.

38
00:02:26.473 --> 00:02:29.277
Chuck: Maybe we aren't in a strange land.

39
00:02:29.278 --> 00:02:38.586
Chuck: I think we are still in the playground, but now we are super tiny.

40
00:02:38.587 --> 00:02:42.601
Dave: Do you mean that Danny and Brad really did shrink us?

41
00:02:42.602 --> 00:02:50.779
Chuck: Yes. Everything around us is normal, except that you and [n3@I are the smallest things in the world.

42
00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:57.024
Dave: Oh man. I'll make sure Danny and Brad suffer for doing this to us!

43
00:02:57.025 --> 00:03:00.355
Chuck: So what do we do now?

44
00:03:00.356 --> 00:03:04.829
Dave: Help! Help! Help!

45
00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:08.107
Chuck: No one is going to hear you, Dave.

46
00:03:08.108 --> 00:03:11.051
Dave: Oh no. You're wrong.

47
00:03:11.052 --> 00:03:16.846
Someone did hear me.
